{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"rhyme-colours-at-the-market","version":1,"title":"Colours at the Market (a colour rhyme)","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Red, red, red are the tomatoes in a heap.\nPile them up high, but not too steep.","sentences":["Red, red, red are the tomatoes in a heap.","Pile them up high, but not too steep."],"alt":"A neat heap of red tomatoes at a stall.","image":{"hash":"sha256:2b61b7b03d5a426ce1f22acf41be85b898768eec22cb102ec5aedc772609439b","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:edb4825c7532b93242671d00f17abbc871f22d2f732f8678b6654b83e31eedc9","durationMs":9520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5440],[5440,9520]],"words":[[0,837],[837,1674],[1674,1988],[1988,2302],[2302,2616],[2616,3453],[3453,3662],[3662,3871],[3871,5440],[5440,5858],[5858,6276],[6276,6485],[6485,7427],[7427,7741],[7741,8055],[8055,8369],[8369,9520]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Yellow, yellow are bananas in a bunch.\nPeel one slowly for a tasty lunch.","sentences":["Yellow, yellow are bananas in a bunch.","Peel one slowly for a tasty lunch."],"alt":"A bunch of yellow bananas.","image":{"hash":"sha256:43ba4c6a0c94369cfaa9e84864fe341413c36d12bfd25aa25080a8fdb79a7bf4","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:d238afc6d9835ab7ce628ebf2b476097e109fac2c6ab1ebb6fd8f9489fd15bf1","durationMs":8400,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4873],[4873,8400]],"words":[[0,1141],[1141,1763],[1763,2074],[2074,2800],[2800,3007],[3007,3214],[3214,4873],[4873,5288],[5288,5599],[5599,6221],[6221,6532],[6532,6739],[6739,7258],[7258,8400]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Orange is the pawpaw, ripe and sweet.\nScoop it with a spoon, a juicy treat.","sentences":["Orange is the pawpaw, ripe and sweet.","Scoop it with a spoon, a juicy treat."],"alt":"A sliced pawpaw with orange flesh.","image":{"hash":"sha256:d448fbc0a34ba8799c87217fbe03f7aea372e0026e918